# Internationalization

Source: `packages/web/src/i18n/i18n.ts` and `packages/web/src/i18n/locales/`.

- Add user-facing keys to both `en.json` and `ru.json`; use the existing `t` API and interpolation syntax.
- Use meaningful scoped keys. Reuse an existing key only when meaning and grammatical context match.
- Avoid assembling translated sentences from fragments. Inspect existing pluralization/date/number helpers before adding locale logic.
- User content, backend identifiers, and code comments are not translation keys.
- Verify the relevant locale and long text/overflow behavior for UI changes.
